      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before Euro‑American settlement, a Ho‑Chunk village called Įnį poroporo—meaning Round Rock—once occupied the land that became Janesville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
